{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTBREAK \u2013 Build. Defend. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTBREAK</strong> is a third-person survival action game where every wave pushes you closer to chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face endless hordes, manage your limited resources, and build your own line of defense in a world swallowed by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is not just a visual \u2014 it\u2019s your lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question remains: <strong>How long can you survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/extras/96dca9687d1458fa6ff46136863e65ff.poster.avif?t=1773044309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/extras/96dca9687d1458fa6ff46136863e65ff.webm?t=1773044309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/extras/96dca9687d1458fa6ff46136863e65ff.mp4?t=1773044309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca1\u00a0Light Up the Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t let the darkness consume you. Players can dynamically place lights to brighten dark areas,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cast real-time shadows, and change the atmosphere of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In OUTBREAK, light isn\u2019t just illumination \u2014 <strong>it\u2019s a weapon of survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/extras/259c66825eccc2cc036c7eb18269f827.poster.avif?t=1773044309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/extras/259c66825eccc2cc036c7eb18269f827.webm?t=1773044309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/extras/259c66825eccc2cc036c7eb18269f827.mp4?t=1773044309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f\u00a0Hold the Line</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos reigns as multiple turrets fire in unison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each muzzle flash and explosion cuts through the dark for a split second of clarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your defenses, manage your resources, and survive every second in the heart of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/extras/69067c0b4f127fb5e4abdfe34a839af7.poster.avif?t=1773044309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/extras/69067c0b4f127fb5e4abdfe34a839af7.webm?t=1773044309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/extras/69067c0b4f127fb5e4abdfe34a839af7.mp4?t=1773044309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddf1\u00a0Build, Defend, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner of the map is yours to shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up barriers, and turrets at strategic points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every structure counts \u2014 every plan prepares you for the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend wisely, build carefully \u2014 <strong>every coin could buy you another breath.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/extras/effd53f69d2b14d04d91fb4e9ab0441e.poster.avif?t=1773044309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/extras/effd53f69d2b14d04d91fb4e9ab0441e.webm?t=1773044309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/extras/effd53f69d2b14d04d91fb4e9ab0441e.mp4?t=1773044309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf\u00a0Precision Placement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new placement system shows valid areas in <strong>green</strong> and blocked areas in <strong>red</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placing a structure isn\u2019t just a click \u2014 it\u2019s a decision between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wrong rotation might cost you the entire wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Player feedback will help guide the ongoing development of <strong>OUTBREAK</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984840?t=1773044309","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984840?t=1773044309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/1659229a5825fe9c6268db53ed40e73e1500b2e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773044309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984840/1659229a5825fe9c6268db53ed40e73e1500b2e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773044309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains frequent v